{"speciesId":568,"names":{"fr":"Miamiasme","es":"Trubbish","en":"Trubbish","ja":"ヤブクロン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il aime les endroits mal tenus. Le gaz qu’il rote endort pendant une semaine."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est né de la mutation d’un sac poubelle contenant des déchets industriels."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The combination of garbage bags and industrial waste caused the chemical reaction that created this Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Wanting more garbage, they follow people who litter. They always belch poison gas."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Wanting more garbage, they follow people who litter. They always belch poison gas."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est né de la mutation d’un sac poubelle contenant des déchets industriels."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon nacido de la reacción química entre una bolsa de basura y residuos industriales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The combination of garbage bags and industrial waste caused the chemical reaction that created this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ゴミ袋が 産業廃棄物と 化学変化を 起こした ことで ポケモンとして 生まれ変わった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aime les endroits mal tenus. Le gaz qu’il rote endort pendant une semaine."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le gustan los lugares con suciedad. Quien inhala los gases que eructa duerme durante una semana."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"不衛生な 場所を 好む。 ゲップのように 吐き出す ガスを 吸いこむと １週間 寝込む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il est né de la mutation d’un sac poubelle contenant des déchets industriels."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon nacido de la reacción química entre una bolsa de basura y residuos industriales."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The combination of garbage bags and industrial waste caused the chemical reaction that created this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ゴミ袋が 産業廃棄物と 化学変化を 起こした ことで ポケモンとして 生まれ変わった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il aime les endroits mal tenus. Le gaz qu’il rote endort pendant une semaine."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le gustan los lugares con suciedad. Quien inhala los gases que eructa duerme durante una semana."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"不衛生な 場所を 好む。 ゲップのように 吐き出す ガスを 吸いこむと １週間 寝込む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il affectionne particulièrement les endroits insalubres. À Alola, il n’est pas rare de voir des Tadmorv courir après des Miamiasme."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Le gustan los lugares sucios. En Alola se lo suele ver junto a Grimer, que lo sigue a todas partes."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Unsanitary places are what they like best. They can be spotted in Alola, often with Grimer in hot pursuit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"不衛生な 場所が 好き。 アローラでは よく ベトベターに 追いまわされる 姿を みかける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Une fois qu’il a gobé assez d’ordures, il relâche un gaz toxique par la bouche. Ne le respirez pas, surtout s’il n’y a aucun hôpital à la ronde."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Tras atiborrarse de basura, eructa unos gases venenosos capaces de llevar a cualquiera al hospital en caso de inhalarlos sin querer."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It gorges on trash until its stomach is full. Then it belches toxic gas. An unlucky whiff of gas will put a person in the hospital."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"満腹まで ゴミを 喰らうと 口から 毒ガスを 吐きだす。 うっかり かぐと 即 入院。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il laisse échapper un gaz toxique quand il respire. Les Grotadmorv, par l’odeur alléchés, accourent alors en salivant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Expulsa gases nocivos al respirar. Cuando Muk se percata del olor, acude salivando."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Poisonous gas leaks out of it when it breathes. Muk that catch a whiff of that stench will come drooling."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"呼吸すると 毒ガスが 漏れる。 匂いを 嗅ぎつけ ベトベトンが よだれを 垂らして やってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le gaz toxique qu’il laisse échapper par sa bouche peut s’avérer dangereux pour les enfants et les jeunes Pokémon qui le respirent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los gases que exhala a modo de eructos pueden poner en peligro la vida de niños y crías Pokémon que los inhalen de forma accidental."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"If a young Pokémon or child breathes in the toxic gas that Trubbish belches out, it could be a life-threatening situation."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ゲップの ように 吐き出す ガスは 小さな 子が 吸い込んでしまうと 命に 関わるほど 危険。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il raffole des endroits sales. Si on laisse traîner des ordures dans une pièce trop longtemps, il finit par en faire son domicile."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Le gustan los lugares insalubres. Puede llegar a establecerse en las casas de aquellas personas que no hagan la limpieza con regularidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"不衛生な 場所が 好き。 ゴミで 汚したまま 放っておくと 部屋にも 現れて 棲みつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est né d’un sac poubelle rempli d’ordures. Le gaz empoisonné qu’il exhale est très apprécié des Smogogo de Galar."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Nació a partir de una rebosante bolsa de basura. Los gases nocivos que eructa son un manjar para los Weezing de Galar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon was born from a bag stuffed with trash. Galarian Weezing relish the fumes belched by Trubbish."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ゴミの 詰まった ゴミ袋から 生まれた。 吐き出す 毒ガスは ガラルの マタドガスの 好物。"}],"varieties":[{"id":568,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",14],[14,"level-up",14],[15,"level-up",14],[16,"level-up",14],[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",25],[15,"level-up",25],[16,"level-up",25],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"level-up",36],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",36],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",36],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",36],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",36],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",36],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"haze","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sludge","learns":[[11,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",18],[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"amnesia","learns":[[11,"level-up",40],[14,"level-up",40],[15,"leve